[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔唉～～～～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“已经天亮啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看了一眼时钟。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是暑假，我却很早就醒来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛这是我的习惯一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊，对啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“该做广播体操了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去做广播体操，好像是我的每日必修课。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没错没错。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我的目标是拿全勤奖来着。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"更何况去做广播体操就能拿到很好吃的特产。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“用双手的手指去揉搓～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“猥亵的运动～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“揉搓揉搓。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，的确够猥亵的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这种运动，真的可以让小孩子来做吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？小孩子？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉自己忘记了什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"什么……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想不起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说到底，为什么来到了这座岛上，还要混在一群孩子里做广播体操啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是因为我闲吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对啊，是因为我闲啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仓库的整理也迟迟不让我做。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的确闲的不行啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“Hey boy!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“Get serious!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，对、对不起！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话说为什么是英语？"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做完广播体操之后，我排队等着盖章。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩A","text":"“今天是西瓜啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天的参与奖好像是西瓜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"依旧是这么大方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“好了，下一个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"轮到我了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拿出集章卡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“嗯？怎么有两张？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“你看，这张上还写着加藤羽未。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"的确，名字那一栏写着呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“加藤…羽未……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊!!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我忘了带羽未来了!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“见鬼，我在干什么啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"居然忘记了羽未，一个人就来了！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不好意思，我回去了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“喂，等一下，还没盖章呢！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一路跑回了家。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我到底在干什么啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么会忘记羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这也睡得太迷糊了吧！"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18141"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"‘羽未？’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11759"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"‘那是谁啊？’"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对……不对不对！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我才没有忘记羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是一时间没反应过来罢了！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13405"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽？你这么早是要去哪？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我在往各家送爷爷船上打到的鱼。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13277"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“之后也会送去你家的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很自然的交谈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是这种自然在此时让我恐惧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……白羽…有关昨天的事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"昨天掀了她裙子之后，我直到最后也没机会道歉，就睡到了今天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本来她理所应当还在生气的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，她居然能这样若无其事地和我交谈？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就仿佛，昨天什么都没发生过――……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这……这个…那件事你还是忘了吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“突然……掀裙子什么的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你那是为了羽未……我回过头就理解了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以已经不生气了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但光是回想起来，就觉得很羞耻……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“就当……没发生过吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从白羽口中听到这个名字，让我不禁松了一口气。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“咦？说起来羽未呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你不是刚做完广播体操回家吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽，不好意思，今天能请你早点过来吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未她不舒服了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以才没来做广播体操……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……这个还不清楚。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知算不算不舒服，总之情况不对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不知怎么说明才好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之，拜托你今天早点来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，我便向着加藤家跑去。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15362"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未还在睡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见她依旧在这里，让我松了一口气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她似乎睡得非常沉，连呼吸都平静到几乎听不见声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但她睡得如此深沉，又让我有些担心了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，羽未？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我害怕起来，喊了一声。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她动了。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15362"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像撒娇一样翻了个身。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来单纯只是睡得很沉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到她这样，我姑且放下心来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她真的好能睡啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“换作平时，都是她第一个起来，然后来叫我起床。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正因为她没来叫我，我才会一个人出门的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不可能的好吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我吐槽了自己一句。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算羽未今天没来叫我起床，我也不应该忘记她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再加上昨天野美希的表现。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“到底是怎么了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不禁自言自语地问道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个夏天，早起和羽未一起去做广播体操已经成了每天的必修课。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而，在几十分钟的时间里，我完全忘记了羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到底出了什么事，我是真的不明白了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，天亮啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“广播体操都已经结束啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15435"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……呜呜～……呜喵～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她哼哼唧唧的就是醒不过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，羽未……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15432"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜喵……呜～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本以为她只是犯困，但事实似乎并非如此。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉她的反应很慢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就好像在和一个幼儿交流一样。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15479"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……在哪……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15482"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后羽未竟然哭了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，这是怎么了……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这已经不叫小孩，简直是婴儿了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明昨天还很正常的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈！妈妈！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮咚……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一看到白羽，羽未就扑上去抱住了她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后就一直紧紧抱着，完全没有松手的意思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是谢天谢地，今天白羽来得早。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“出什么事了……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也不是很清楚……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“只是，我总觉得哪里不对劲。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未自己自不必说，包括我在内的周围环境也不对。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜呜～……呜喵～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这是怎么了啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽也有点摸不着头脑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她撒娇的样子……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就好像是个小宝宝一样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“还童现象？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也听说过，具体什么意思？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我知道的也不多……好像是说行为变成儿童一样吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是字面意思啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不过这应该发生在更小一点的孩子身上……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽抱着羽未，用忧虑的目光看向她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感受到白羽的目光，羽未的神色也变得不安起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15573"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13248"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，妈妈在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她赶忙露出微笑以安抚羽未。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯，抱抱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是放下了心，羽未把脸埋进了白羽的胸口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“会不会是上次落水留下的影响？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说只有一小会儿，但她的确一度停止了呼吸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因此让她的心理状态变得不稳定了吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们两个再怎么想，也不可能得出有把握的答案。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“还是应该带她去一次医院吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是医生说她没问题啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15363"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……医院…不要……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，羽未更加用力地抱紧了白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是简单易懂的拒绝姿态。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她是真的倒退回小宝宝阶段了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13373"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，怎么啦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“和我玩。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13421"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“好啊，但是首先要吃饭哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i65"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽正在厨房里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她熟练地做着早饭，而羽未则乐呵呵地看着她。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“做好啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我来帮忙端。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15415"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“羽未也来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13277"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那么，你来端腌菜的碟子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15412"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未双手捧着盛有细切腌菜的小碟子，端到起居室的桌上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她眼睛直勾勾地盯着碟子，完全没看脚下，让我捏了一把汗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我紧紧跟在她身后，以便她摔倒的时候能扶住她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天的早饭是盐烤竹荚鱼、蛤蜊味噌汤、腌菜和海藻色拉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，今天能用筷子吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15369"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……呜～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她盯着矮桌上的筷子，似乎在思考什么。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“怎么啦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15479"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……那个……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未略显不好意思地张大嘴。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13248"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未还真是爱撒娇呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽苦笑着，把饭菜喂进羽未嘴里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就仿佛是带着孩子过新婚生活一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我是爸爸，白羽是妈妈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而羽未是我们真正的孩子……"},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i731"},{"op":"image","layer":259,"image":"i18131"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25638"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i249"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘虽■■开始……我■些■怕…’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘■在，已经■■了。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘爸■■■是，羽■的■■真■■了。’"},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咦……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我是不是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忘记了什么很重要的事……？"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1450"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吃完饭，我们三个开始折纸玩。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为羽未提出想折纸飞机。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一开始，羽未在白羽的身边折着纸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，她又似乎在期待什么一般，一直在偷偷看白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她是想要白羽做些什么事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你想要什么呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……腿上。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她是想坐在白羽的腿上折纸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“想坐在妈妈的腿上折？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那就坐在妈妈腿上折吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽拍了拍自己的大腿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未开心地坐到了她的腿上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后，她便坐在白羽的腿上开开心心地折起纸来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哼～哼～哼哼～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她心情很好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过与羽未的好心情恰成反比，她的折纸实在是歪歪扭扭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要是不仔细折出尖角，纸飞机是飞不起来的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯～？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是她重新折了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是歪歪扭扭。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1451"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜……呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本来能折得很好的纸飞机，如今却是不成模样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还是费了一番功夫才好不容易折成这样。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“算了，飞飞看吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15499"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嘿！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"加之她只是胡乱一扔，飞机立刻就落地了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15527"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未带着一脸沮丧，看着掉在地上的纸飞机。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，扔纸飞机的诀窍，是要轻轻扔。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15528"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜喵……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13237"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我们一起来折吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽伸出了手。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15420"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……能用这个折吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她指着套装里一张带着虹彩的美工纸问我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是一张能随着角度变化而映出七彩反光的美工纸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，因为金纸和银纸都让白羽用掉了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好漂亮的纸……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，飞起来一定更好看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，我看了一眼白羽。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13266"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“过来，羽未。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她又把羽未放到自己腿上，用自己的手扶着羽未的手，两人一起折纸飞机。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1452"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未，你按着这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这样……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，就这样不要动哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽和羽未两个人顺利折着纸飞机。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1453"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好了……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，折好啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i249"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2304,"image":"i1454"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这次折出了一架漂亮的纸飞机。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"翅膀舒展开来，映射出的虹彩分外耀眼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是漂亮的合作作品。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，我也折好啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“顺便问一下，这架飞机叫什么名字？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15324"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“超级最棒超级妈妈的火气·满级！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，感觉自己完全赢不过啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是，男人就是明知赢不过也要挑战。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，来比一比吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15320"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13237"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也折好啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2304,"image":"i1421"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这架我记得是……Super Mustang Fire Cosmic Mode Lv.VII？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13276"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“Ex Neo Maximum Blast Next II。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……我怎么觉得长得一样啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15324"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……好帅啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且你又教坏小孩子了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1792},{"op":"clear","layer":2304},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不说了，我们去外面飞吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i28"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们拿着各自折出的纸飞机来到了屋外。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你喊预备，然后一起扔哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13277"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“预备…”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15538"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嘿！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"三架纸飞机向着蓝天，飞得又高又远。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"飞在最前面的是羽未扔出的，闪耀虹彩的纸飞机。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被太阳光一照，留下一道耀眼的轨迹。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我和白羽的飞机则紧随其后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就仿佛在默默跟随着跑在前头的孩子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这画面让我感到隐约的一丝怀念。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"玩够了纸飞机，羽未转眼便睡着了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她正枕在白羽的腿上午睡。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“就好像用完了电池一样睡着了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的像个小宝宝一样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正在呼呼大睡的羽未，额头上浮现出了汗珠。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她好像很热啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拿来团扇，给她扇风。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15425"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呼……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哈哈，她好像很舒服啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们两个看着熟睡的羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夏日午后的慵懒时光就这样过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"若不是还在担心羽未的状态，或许这真的会是一段幸福的时光。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是，我感到内心渗出的黑色污迹正在逐渐扩展开来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明天我们该做什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放下那些负面的想法，我打开了羽未的绘图日记。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽也凑过来看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我翻开明天那页，只见上面画着她和白羽泡澡的画面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她要和妈妈一起泡澡呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13277"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这个没问题啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“泡澡。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“可是，天气……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我是不是应该做个倒吊的晴天娃娃来求雨？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i731"},{"op":"image","layer":259,"image":"i18131"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25638"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i249"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13287"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"‘昨天的雨……早就知道了？’"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘■。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"‘……――就连明天…也早就知道了？’"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘■。’"},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……咦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i731"},{"op":"image","layer":259,"image":"i18131"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i25638"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i249"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘……我■，见■妈…’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15360"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘■果……总■错■……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘……唉？’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘■过，这■夏天■■定……不再■■了……’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘……因■…这一■是最■的■■了……’"},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":259},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有什么声音，在我脑海里……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不像是逐渐浮现……而是在逐渐消失…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛逐渐流逝，逐渐剥落……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉那是非常重要的事，但现在连这也不能确定了……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我感觉自己忘了一些重要的事……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“重要的事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我不知道是什么事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这让我感到非常懊恼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然又感到一阵轻松。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本来感觉有些东西卡在心头，但如今已不复存在了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之，我觉得明天真的会下雨。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我没有根据。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但就是有这种预感。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]